Modifications: names and paths changed to pcs-open.golf; claims carry several named integers
read from claim.json instead of one integer; the stubs render one placeholder per claim field;
scores are computed from a published price kept outside the pinned contract; the axiom audit
checks every declaration of the protected modules; ots.golf's program-size measurements and
service are not included.
